<title>JAPAN: Nikkei Dec options/futures SQ set at 20,380.32 - OSE.</title>
<headline>Nikkei Dec options/futures SQ set at 20,380.32 - OSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said on Friday that the settlement price, called &quot;special quotations&quot; (SQ), for the key Nikkei 225 average's options and futures contracts for December was set at 20,380.32.</p>
</text>
